description:
Just before Christmas night, zombies invade Santa&rsquo;s base and steal all the gifts! Guide Santa, launch him at the zombies, use physics to knock them down, clear every level and save Christmas! Full description A group of zombies attacks Santa&rsquo;s base and steals the presents meant for children. The elves are in shock &mdash; now it&rsquo;s up to you! Launch Santa Claus at the zombies, use physics to make them fall or crash, destroy all enemies and complete every level. Simple rules, fun physics, and a clear goal: recover the gifts and save Christmas! &zwj;

How to play:
Mouse click or tap to play

